### Ephemeral List Examples

```perl
# List from range operator
my @numbers = (1..10);    # 1..10 produces List, converts to Array
# Type flow: Range → List → Array

# List from subroutine return
sub get_pair() { return (1, 2); }
my @pair = get_pair();    # Returns List, converts to Array
# Type flow: Return List → List → Array

# List as parameters
sub sum(\$x, \$y) { return \$x + \$y; }
sum(5, 10);               # Arguments form List
# Type flow: (5, 10) → List → unpacked to \$x, \$y

# List to Hash conversion
my %hash = (a => 1, b => 2);  # List converts to Hash
# Type flow: List → Hash
```

